// Arithmetic size_expr ABI: out.len emits as a derived expression, not __len_out.
// The loop-counter names (__i0, __i1, ...) are numbered per function, so the patterns
// match the BOUND only — the counter's index is not what this snapshot is about.
// An UNNAMED length still emits the auto-generated __len_<param>, and a parameter whose
// length IS another's emits no length of its own.
